cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ahsi-pipeline: a configuration-driven L1 preprocessing base for spaceborne hyperspectral AHSI data"
abstract: >-
  Engineering base for radiometric calibration, RPC + DEM orthorectification,
  interchangeable atmospheric/normalisation backends, band screening, unified
  quality gating and optional SCS+C terrain illumination correction of Chinese
  spaceborne hyperspectral L1 products.
authors:
  - name: "ahsi-pipeline contributors"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hakimdkfhdhdjdj356-cpu/ahsi-pipeline"
keywords:
  - hyperspectral
  - remote sensing
  - AHSI
  - GF-5B
  - radiometric calibration
  - atmospheric correction
